  "description": "The meme uses a visual of a man with a beard and head covering (commonly associated with Muslim men) to represent 'most religions' in a context that may be perceived as dismissive of religious extremism or violence. This visual choice can reinforce harmful stereotypes that associate Islam with terrorism or violence, even though the text claims 'most religions are religions of peace'. The meme promotes a simplistic, unnuanced view of religion, which may be misleading and potentially harmful in contexts where religious groups are associated with violence or conflict.",
